{"v3_c5165a0702ca74b6fdab3b77":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです！\nお疲れさまです🍵\nブログ開いてくださりありがとうございます\n乃木坂46 6期生の大越ひなのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はクリスマスですね\n思い出、本当に毎回書道部時代のものしかなくてごめんなさいなのですが、この時期は駅ホームで泣きながらセブンティーンアイスを食べてました🍦‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の所属してた書道部は年明けすぐに自分たちだけで大きな展覧会を開催するという決まりがあって、年も大詰めなこの時期はみんな作品制作や会場の構想に明け暮れていたので、\n同期は女子が6人も、華のJKが6人もいたのに、誰ひとりクリスマスには触れてもいなかった記憶です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くなると部活時間も短くなって夢中になってた制作も丁度波に乗ってきたタイミングでチャイムが鳴って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰り支度のために急いで筆洗おうとしても水が冷たくてうまく洗えなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見回りの先生に早く帰れと怒られながら急いで道具を片付けて、門が閉まるギリギリで学校から飛び出して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部室に箱詰めだったから今私たちすごい墨のにおいするだろうなと思いながら、帰り道自転車を漕いだり漕がなかったりしてました🚲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと着いた駅で、電車の間隔が30分くらいあるのにむき出しのホームにはアイスの自販機しかなくて、寒いけど手持ち無沙汰だから1つアイスを買って食べて電車を待ち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"耐えられん寒さと作品が期日までにできるかの不安と、単純にセブンティーンアイスの美味しさに意味もなくウルウルとしていたわけです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"富士山頂で食べるあったかいご飯ほど美味しいものはないと思っていましたが、結構拮抗するおいしさでしたよ、平地の真冬のセブンティーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪とか絶対ひかないマン(orウーマン)はぜひお試しあれです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスのクの字もなかったけど思い返せばなんて瑞々しい青春なんだか🎅🏼🎁\nどんな苦い思い出でも時間の治癒力はハンパない、ほんとうに半端が、ないのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobvYQP2E.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬆️乃木坂スター誕生！SIXでさせていただいたサンタさんコスプレの図(先日サンタさん回でした！)(Huluで見られます！)(楽しかった収録😊)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこにねじ込もうか考えましたが分からないから絶対違うここら辺で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう考えると時を重ねることもこう、人生において中々あなどれないですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"重ねてる今現在がとんでもなく不安でも\nこれからもっとよくなる\n自分でなんとか良くしていく\n信じて歯を食いしばって前向きましょう\n今の私はそうするしかない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大越ひなのブログ#️⃣クリスマスのキラキラしてない方の思い出回 でした！\n皆さんのキラキラしてない方の思い出がもしあったら、聞かせてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しない年の瀬で気づいたら迎えている当日も\n毎年感じる街中の電飾が消えたあとの喪失感も\nこの光らない部分も全部クリスマスの、人生の醍醐味と言えるような、面白い生きかたをしたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🎄🎁🎅🌟🦌🛷🧦🔔🍗🎂\nとはいえやっぱりちょっとくやしいので最後にありったけのクリスマスを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます\nでは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大越ひなの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いてて気づいたけど雨降ってる☔️\n帰り、気をつけてね！"}],"source":"official"},"crw-nogi-2862":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/120210_195901.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の題名は、マイマイに決めてもらった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1041.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  約束どうり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私物のカバン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/5009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です(^∀^)ノ\nかわいいでしょ？\n母さんにかってもらったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1041.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回は、カバンの中身を公開しちゃうよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、川後ヒナちゃんの手が、写っておりま〜す"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは、質問に答えていきま〜す"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8300.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日に何が欲しい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8284.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1108.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会での握手時間を長くしてほしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、春から上京なんで、家におく、小物がほしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8300.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の時のヘアー前ポニーテールって言ってたけどツイン？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8284.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイ！最近ツインに変わったんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あははwwww"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8300.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テストとかないの？ちゃんと勉強してる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8284.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テストありますよ〜wwww\n   勉強しないといけな〜い(^_^;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8300.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなキャラクターは何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8284.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スポンジボブとかぁ、カエルさんとかぁ←\nリアルなカエルはちょっと…。\n元気な感じのがすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8300.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂と学校生活どちらか１つにしぼるとしたらどっち？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8284.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1108.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとも難しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1108.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校では、集団生活の大切さや勉強や人間関係などいろいろ学べて、いいしぃ、\n乃木坂は、メンバーといて楽しいし、やりがいのある仕事でとってもたのしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様と触れ合うことができ、めちゃめちゃ幸せで、めちゃめちゃパワーがわいて……。めっちゃ言いたいこと沢山あるけど長くなるからここら辺で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁヤッパリどっちも好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１つなんてしぼれない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sorry\nwwww\n以上です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんと、電車ナウ(^з^)-☆Chu!!\nう゛ーーーー満員だー(^_^;)\n私の地元は満員なんてあり得ないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車もそんな走ってないし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！みて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元は普通の道路に電車がしってるんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュッシュッポッポ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/120129_1404010001.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメント下さりありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/0179.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいつもパワーをもらってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のクイズの答えは、私もわかりません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また調べときます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/0179.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sorry\nBye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/0038.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/11/1141.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-30197":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね、朝早かったんだけど\n家に帰ってきて\n夕方過ぎから今の今まで寝ちゃってて\n妹に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹「お姉ちゃんブログ書いたー？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「んー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹「おー！よかった！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「zzz。。。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹「ん？  ねー？ほんとに書いたー？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「んーーーーー」    \n   「(｡ρω-｡)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  「はっっっっっっっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"   「(´⊙ω⊙`)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、なり飛び起きたところでございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方過ぎに\nおかしなガムボールを見ながら\nうとうとしてきてる日奈子をお母さんがみて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母「このあと寝ちゃうんじゃない～？\n  先にブログ書いたらー？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「大丈夫～！寝ないから！平気！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3分後............"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「(｡ρω-｡)zzzzzz」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です。ごめんなさい。ほんとに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでね、なにが言いたいかというと\nコメントは見たんだけど\nヒナコセレクト(仮)と冒頭あいさつと終わりのあいさつをまとめきれてないので\nこんなブログになってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´；д；｀)ごめんなさい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもね、夜ご飯を満腹感を200%こせるとこまで食べて、すぐに寝たから\nなんか胃もたれしてるしね～\n食べてすぐ寝たら太るのにね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー。。。しくじったよー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カナシイタケ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/19/1527280/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/19/1527280/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/19/1527280/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のブログのヒナコセレクト(仮)と\n冒頭あいさつと終わりのあいさつは\n昨日のブログと今日のブログの\nコメントから選びます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛び起きたから目が覚めちゃった(´；д；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、もうみんな寝る時間。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サミシイタケ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいっ(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝るの？みなさん(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう寝ちゃいますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん(ノ_・。)。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読みながら寝落ちれたら幸せだな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい(ノ_・。)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-20991":{"block